{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:11 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:11 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:11 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img alt=\"現場為筲箕灣東駿苑。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a03c5112451ce0b3ab5c8ed0d54b738b/2026-11/011_6.png\"/><p>今日（27日）下午2時許，警方接獲報案，指一名39歲姓林男子於筲箕灣東駿苑的寓所內暈倒，救援人員接報到場，證實事主當場死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。據了解，事主疑在家中跌倒受傷，並失救致死，家人發現後立即報警求助。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:23:53.289135+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T15:11:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:54.531302+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:26.965731+00:00","content_hash":"9213fbcc5002b899cae3ba5ab55b139bb1bd43fc5016eadd20a07b0d5d7276cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}